      "lastEdited": "2026-03-14T09:10:00.000Z",
      "content": [
        { "type": "paragraph", "text": "Slab climbing uses balance and foot precision on less-than-vertical terrain." },
        { "type": "quote", "text": "Trust your feet before pulling with your hands." },
        { "type": "list", "style": "numbered", "items": ["Keep hips over feet", "Use quiet foot placements", "Stand up instead of pulling"] }
      ]
    },
    {
