      "lastEdited": "2026-03-14T09:35:00.000Z",
      "content": [
        { "type": "paragraph", "text": "A dyno is a dynamic move where one or both hands leave the wall to catch a distant hold." },
        { "type": "list", "style": "numbered", "items": ["Load legs and hips", "Commit to the move", "Absorb the catch with tension"] }
      ]
    },
    {
