      "title": "Mantle",
      "lastEdited": "2026-03-14T09:40:00.000Z",
      "content": [
        { "type": "paragraph", "text": "A mantle is a top-out style movement where you press down on holds to move above them." },
        { "type": "list", "style": "bulleted", "items": ["Feels like getting out of a pool", "Needs triceps and core stability", "Often appears near boulder tops"] }
      ]
    },
    {
