      "content": [
        { "type": "paragraph", "text": "A redpoint is completing a route cleanly after prior attempts and practice." },
        { "type": "list", "style": "bulleted", "items": ["Often an intermediate/advanced goal", "Builds from repeated effort", "Includes route refinement"] }
      ]
    },
    {
